


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_26787215:


    "到了晚上阳菜的烧也还没退下去。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_aca1b2a9:



    voice "HIN_0798"
    hina "「哈啊……哈啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_ee1ac4a4:


    "阳菜的胸口剧烈起伏，吐出热气。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_404d546c:


    "文注视着阳菜，紧抿的下唇渐渐失去了血色。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_8546d7ba:



    voice "RIN_0629"
    rin "「嗯……差不多该睡了吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_d827087b:


    "将书签夹到书里后，伦伸了个大懒腰。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_a357bcf2:



    voice "RIN_0630"
    rin "「浅生也睡吧，不然身子也会跟着一起垮的」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_24444672:


    "伦的胳膊肘压在床边的栏杆上，冲着下面的文说道。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_f248da59:



    voice "FUM_0597"
    fumi "「好。但是，我晚点再睡」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_aa1c4ca4:


    "文只是抬头冲伦微微笑了下，并未从阳菜的床边离开。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_197c7b15:



    voice "RIN_0631"
    rin "「要不要我替你？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_d465ff05:



    voice "FUM_0598"
    fumi "「不用，没事的，绪方同学你先睡吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_f39b8abc:



    voice "RIN_0632"
    rin "「………喔」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_9904e8b9:



    voice "FUM_0599"
    fumi "「啊……抱歉」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_00bf7170:



    voice "RIN_0633"
    rin "「……别太勉强自己了」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_01006e8d:


    "伦关了床灯钻进了被窝。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_c1354f7b:



    voice "FUM_0600"
    fumi "「……谢谢」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_278c7e29:


    "………………"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_0fd4d656:


    "…………"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_41990c3e:


    "隔壁照进来的月光微微地衬出了文的轮廓。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_b0eeec8b:



    voice "FUM_0601"
    fumi "「阳菜……抱歉」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_3f88a626:


    "面对文的细语，阳菜只发出了大口的喘息声。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_dd87db7e:



    voice "FUM_0602"
    fumi "「……但是，谢谢你」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_5cc7f9ab:



    voice "FUM_0603"
    fumi "「今天阳菜为我追回来的羽毛，对我来说的意义更加重要，成了世界上唯一的宝物」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_4cead62b:


    "文将手放在毛衣的口袋上，里面正放着那根羽毛。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_5f185190:



    voice "FUM_0604"
    fumi "「为此，害你成了这副样子……」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_24c8597d:


    "文又露出难受的表情。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_4a84158a:



    voice "FUM_0605"
    fumi "「……其实我已经不需要什么羽毛了」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_f94b21b5:



    voice "FUM_0606"
    fumi "「因为阳菜你说会和我一起去相信的」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_696bd748:


    "文用双手轻轻握住阳菜的手。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_9e435c9b:



    voice "FUM_0607"
    fumi "「我现在也相信天使的存在。但那并不是看不见的，摸不到的……现在天使就在我的眼前」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_a9296afb:



    voice "FUM_0608"
    fumi "「我想这根羽毛果然就是阳菜的。对于我来说天使就是——」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_a269c1be:



    voice "HIN_0799"
    hina "「嗯……」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_5a67df56:


    "突然阳菜动了动脑袋，敷在她额头上的湿毛巾掉了下来。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_92f6d934:


    "看着阳菜转向了自己，文吓了一跳。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_563e6b08:



    voice "HIN_0800"
    hina "「哈……啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_41f16329:


    "看来只是翻了下身。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_5c666c5b:



    voice "FUM_0609"
    fumi "「……我换下毛巾吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_df9966b0:


    "文一边拾起掉落在枕边的毛巾，一边注视着阳菜的脸。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_2b750312:



    voice "FUM_0610"
    fumi "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_08f705a2:


    "嘴唇缓缓地靠近，触到了阳菜汗涔涔的小额头上。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_3f6dc6dc:



    voice "FUM_0611"
    fumi "「啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_b5529b0e:


    "文的嘴唇仿佛贴上了一团火，使她慌忙抬起头来。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_75e4f180:



    voice "FUM_0612"
    fumi "「……好烫」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_1cf7c0f4:


    "文的指尖抚过自己亲过阳菜的唇。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_c9c7454e:



    voice "HIN_0801"
    hina "「……会传染喔？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_efb94094:



    voice "FUM_0613"
    fumi "「呀！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_f22b4d55:



    voice "FUM_0614"
    fumi "「你，你醒着吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_86b4a7a7:



    voice "HIN_0802"
    hina "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_881ca79c:


    "文等了一会儿，发现阳菜并没回答她。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_2d00b44c:


    "看来只是梦话。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_214db48d:



    voice "FUM_0615"
    fumi "「……吓死我了」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_4d7ed53c:


    "文安心地舒了口气。现在她的脸颊有阳菜那么烫。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_731d1f45:



    voice "FUM_0616"
    fumi "「……我去换条凉一点毛巾」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_05798e15:


    "文自言自语着，把温热的毛巾放进洗脸盆，然后拧干。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_08cad14b:



    voice "FUM_0617"
    fumi "「嗯……」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_9ce01b8c:


    "用手指挑开阳菜的刘海为她擦汗。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_ec71cf1d:



    voice "FUM_0618"
    fumi "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_a42715bc:


    "看了一会儿刚才自己亲过的地方后，才在她额头上放上凉毛巾。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_53a87129:



    voice "HIN_0803"
    hina "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_4f0f59e6:


    "痛苦的表情看上去似乎有所缓解。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_2f7fd46b:



    voice "FUM_0619"
    fumi "「……在睡着的时候偷袭，太狡猾了吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_9fb62818:


    "文笑着将阳菜的手臂掖回到被子里。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_368a8e39:



    voice "FUM_0620"
    fumi "「晚安，我的天使」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_d396eb75:


    "文这么说着拿起了脸盆。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_ad317ce2:



    voice "HIN_0804"
    hina "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou1_08_cf6bdc95:


    "阳菜看上去像在微笑，是错觉吗？"
